{
  "id": "RAW_3fc4f73bab",
  "title": "Qwen 开源 Qwen-Image-2.1：7B 统一生成与编辑并原生支持透明图像 · AIHOT",
  "url": "https://aihot.news/items/cmu9tfhu904turokx2vfjy34f",
  "date": "2026-09-20 20:00:00",
  "author": "noreply@aihot.news (Qwen：Blog Retrieval（API）)",
  "siteName": "AIHOT — 精选",
  "content": "<html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <figure>\n   <img src=\"https://aihot.news/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fqianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com%2FQwen-Image%2Fimage2.1%2Fbanner_en.png&amp;exp=1789992000&amp;sig=a654e66358dca08484a6461e42d1bf0aa1546cea25264e6a47a92d10d93d0c21\" alt=\"Qwen-Image-2.1 banner\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"same-origin\">\n  </figure>\n  <p><a href=\"https://github.com/QwenLM/Qwen-Image-2.1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow ugc\">GITHUB</a> <a href=\"https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen-Image-2.1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow ugc\">HUGGING FACE</a> <a href=\"https://www.modelscope.cn/models/Qwen/Qwen-Image-2.1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow ugc\">MODELSCOPE</a></p>\n  <p>我们很高兴开源 <strong>Qwen-Image-2.1</strong>，这是 Qwen 家族中的一款图像模型，在生成质量、推理效率与成本之间取得平衡。Qwen-Image-2.1 将文生图生成与图像编辑统一在单一模型中，其视觉生成组件仅 <strong>7B 参数</strong>，并原生支持生成和编辑透明图像。</p>\n  <p>本次更新带来四项关键改进：</p>\n  <ul>\n   <li><strong>紧凑高效</strong>：轻量级架构与推理优化在图像质量与计算成本之间取得平衡。</li>\n   <li><strong>原生透明，统一创作与编辑</strong>：根据提示词生成普通或透明图像，编辑透明图层，并从照片中提取主体。</li>\n   <li><strong>多样化编辑</strong>：最多可使用 <strong>10 张参考图像</strong>，指定局部编辑，保留人物与产品，并处理各类任务。</li>\n   <li><strong>逼真质感与精致美学</strong>：改进的排版、人像光影与精细细节让生成图像更具视觉吸引力。</li>\n  </ul>\n  <h2>紧凑高效<a href=\"https://qwen.ai/blog?id=qwen-image-2.1#compact-and-efficient\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow ugc\">#</a></h2>\n  <p>Qwen-Image-2.1 采用轻量级架构。其视觉生成组件包含 <strong>32 层单流 DiT 和 7B 参数</strong>。尽管体量紧凑，该模型仍能提供出色的图像生成质量。下方的 Qwen-Image-Bench 对比展示了它与其他开源和闭源模型的表现对比。</p>\n  <figure>\n   <img src=\"https://aihot.news/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fqianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com%2FQwen-Image%2Fimage2.1%2Fimages%2Fexample-01.png&amp;exp=1789992000&amp;sig=c7c10ce8c059bd8464f77f4f4729918f8be2e3ef6751a3e56844d35b56131415\" alt=\"Qwen-Image-Bench evaluation comparison\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"same-origin\">\n   <figcaption>\n    <p>Qwen-Image-Bench 评测对比</p>\n   </figcaption>\n  </figure>\n  <p>推理效率是另一个重点，尤其是在使用多张输入图像进行编辑时。这一优化来自 <strong>混合粒度注意力架构</strong>。文本（包括系统前缀和编辑指令）使用 token 级因果掩码，而图像生成使用块级掩码。<strong>KV cache 复用</strong> 使输入图像和编辑指令可作为静态上下文，在第一步中计算并缓存，从而提升推理效率并降低内存占用。</p>\n  <figure>\n   <img src=\"https://aihot.news/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fqianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com%2FQwen-Image%2Fimage2.1%2Fimages%2Fexample-03.png&amp;exp=1789992000&amp;sig=b56dac01eb1cd8208c73907cf7d75c2200fa5e15294e7acc801c8bd6bf993ff5\" alt=\"Qwen-Image-2.1 mixed-granularity attention architecture\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"same-origin\">\n   <figcaption>\n    <p>Qwen-Image-2.1 混合粒度注意力架构</p>\n   </figcaption>\n  </figure>\n  <h2>原生透明度，统一创作与编辑<a href=\"https://qwen.ai/blog?id=qwen-image-2.1#native-transparency-unified-creation-and-editing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow ugc\">#</a></h2>\n  <p>原生透明度是本次发布的一大新增功能。2025 年 12 月，我们推出了 Qwen-Image-Layered，作为一款支持透明图像生成的专用模型。Qwen-Image-2.1 现将这一能力整合进统一模型，通过提示词决定是输出普通图像还是带透明度通道的图像。</p>\n  <p>以下是由文本直接生成的透明图像示例：</p>\n  <img src=\"https://aihot.news/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fqianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com%2FQwen-Image%2Fimage2.1%2Fimages%2Fexample-04.png&amp;exp=1789992000&amp;sig=88709e474b78ed4b2f2964902b9d30c6f31d62fd88767382076d0d001f4666c5\" alt=\"Transparent images generated from text (1)\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"same-origin\"> <img src=\"https://aihot.news/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fqianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com%2FQwen-Image%2Fimage2.1%2Fimages%2Fexample-05.png&amp;exp=1789992000&amp;sig=6702c6291ce0f5fc31e4334effb30e7fa4d3064e7b561ba7e16dc38ecc036835\" alt=\"Transparent images generated from text (2)\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"same-origin\"> <img src=\"https://aihot.news/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fqianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com%2FQwen-Image%2Fimage2.1%2Fimages%2Fexample-06.png&amp;exp=1789992000&amp;sig=1267b740d3cba782f6a812c888dc51f95230c105915c36fc7ab493215d36f315\" alt=\"Transparent images generated from text (3)\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"same-origin\">\n  <p>除了单个主体之外，该模型还能生成由多个元素构成的更复杂的透明图像，为设计和素材创作开辟了更多可能性。</p>\n  <img src=\"https://aihot.news/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fqianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com%2FQwen-Image%2Fimage2.1%2Fimages%2Fexample-07.png&amp;exp=1789992000&amp;sig=189b8f6d4780636fa9e1513c009dde8af21defa522f0a68db77ef9f5ebdeb3e8\" alt=\"Transparent compositions with multiple elements (1)\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"same-origin\"> <img src=\"https://aihot.news/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fqianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com%2FQwen-Image%2Fimage2.1%2Fimages%2Fexample-08.png%3Fv%3Dcac12076c2cd&amp;exp=1789992000&amp;sig=104f14d00259aa9b0c36557fd7226c3b537037bd10b49ed75a96391c183b8a77\" alt=\"Transparent compositions with multiple elements (2)\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"same-origin\">\n  <p>通过统一生成与编辑，Qwen-Image-2.1 还支持直接编辑透明图像。例如，它可以在保留透明背景的同时改变主体的表情。左侧为输入，右侧为编辑结果。</p>\n  <img src=\"https://aihot.news/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fqianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com%2FQwen-Image%2Fimage2.1%2Fimages%2Fexample-09.png%3Fv%3Dee4de1b5241d&amp;exp=1789992000&amp;sig=e21d143c7ff2c936e56546cfbb8e21afeb7d00d9b2e6b6027be70cd51cce609b\" alt=\"Expression editing on a transparent image: input and result (1)\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"same-origin\"> <img src=\"https://aihot.news/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fqianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com%2FQwen-Image%2Fimage2.1%2Fimages%2Fexample-10.png%3Fv%3D611bf03abb39&amp;exp=1789992000&amp;sig=63f9da2991757a5d9fb71639d9073f4da9489b648c13f4d909b5c6ebc791fb66\" alt=\"Expression editing on a transparent image: input and result (2)\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"same-origin\">\n  <p>透明图层中的文字同样可以编辑。在下面的示例中，“BLOOM”被替换为“Qwen-Image”。</p>\n  <img src=\"https://aihot.news/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fqianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com%2FQwen-Image%2Fimage2.1%2Fimages%2Fexample-11.png%3Fv%3D1f2803db504a&amp;exp=1789992000&amp;sig=50fc2edc1c4caf83ec21ba61652c3bba116efce65fd1a3a005e884725fe37de4\" alt=\"Transparent text editing: replacing BLOOM with Qwen-Image (1)\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"same-origin\"> <img src=\"https://aihot.news/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fqianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com%2FQwen-Image%2Fimage2.1%2Fimages%2Fexample-12.png%3Fv%3D9d0fa2b0e13a&amp;exp=1789992000&amp;sig=2f3d79e698215a30eda8067c04959138223a1c0df57b69d640220eb5bbc0a17c\" alt=\"Transparent text editing: replacing BLOOM with Qwen-Image (2)\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"same-origin\">\n  <p>这一能力也延伸到了真实照片。给定一张 RGB 图像，该模型可以将所需主体提取为带透明度的 RGBA 图层，从而更便于在后续的设计与合成工作中复用元素。</p>\n  <img src=\"https://aihot.news/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fqianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com%2FQwen-Image%2Fimage2.1%2Fimages%2Fexample-13.png&amp;exp=1789992000&amp;sig=79b9f84b7491a8b5e92901bdb12f8705b9ef9b1be8a72117874ad3adb9b6680c\" alt=\"Extracting a transparent RGBA layer from an RGB photograph (1)\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"same-origin\"> <img src=\"https://aihot.news/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fqianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com%2FQwen-Image%2Fimage2.1%2Fimages%2Fexample-14.png&amp;exp=1789992000&amp;sig=93992132800c46b915802c9cf93f6b1e53a5383bac347d37d0b82469551f874d\" alt=\"Extracting a transparent RGBA layer from an RGB photograph (2)\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"same-origin\">\n  <h2>多样化编辑<a href=\"https://qwen.ai/blog?id=qwen-image-2.1#versatile-editing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow ugc\">#</a></h2>\n  <p>Qwen-Image-2.1 在四个方面改进了编辑能力：多参考图像、局部编辑、保真度保持以及任务覆盖范围。</p>\n  <h3>多参考：最多 10 张输入图像<a href=\"https://qwen.ai/blog?id=qwen-image-2.1#multiple-references-up-to-10-input-images\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow ugc\">#</a></h3>\n  <p>Qwen-Image-2.1 支持<strong>最多 10 张参考图像</strong>，可将多个主体和素材组合成一幅协调的构图。在下面的合影示例中，左侧的六张单人肖像被汇聚到一张照片中。</p>\n  <figure>\n   <img src=\"https://aihot.news/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fqianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com%2FQwen-Image%2Fimage2.1%2Fimages%2Fexample-15.png&amp;exp=1789992000&amp;sig=c845c21ce903d7c72fe3e80a55bf431545ee64b1359980ee33e6c7ab31155075\" alt=\"A group photograph generated from six portrait references\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"same-origin\">\n   <figcaption>\n    <p>一张由六张人像参考图生成的全家福照片</p>\n   </figcaption>\n  </figure>\n  <p>在虚拟试穿场景中，五个输入——模特、服装、鞋子、包和帽子——可以组合成一套完整的穿搭。</p>\n  <figure>\n   <img src=\"https://aihot.news/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fqianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com%2FQwen-Image%2Fimage2.1%2Fimages%2Fexample-16.png&amp;exp=1789992000&amp;sig=3424445743d99143f24f19f3055b55f4e4a736e96b3f72ce83bb5a581999c4fb\" alt=\"A complete outfit generated from five reference images\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"same-origin\">\n   <figcaption>\n    <p>一套由五张参考图生成的完整穿搭</p>\n   </figcaption>\n  </figure>\n  <p>在室内设计场景中，模型可以使用 10 张家具图片生成一个完整的房间布置。</p>\n  <figure>\n   <img src=\"https://aihot.news/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fqianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com%2FQwen-Image%2Fimage2.1%2Fimages%2Fexample-17.png&amp;exp=1789992000&amp;sig=5a60646f23336e31795c823df3ac57eb60ec7b1c1af9a430ac801f4f1c48cdd6\" alt=\"An interior generated from ten furnishing references\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"same-origin\">\n   <figcaption>\n    <p>一个由十张家具参考图生成的室内场景</p>\n   </figcaption>\n  </figure>\n  <h3>局部编辑：灵活的区域选择<a href=\"https://qwen.ai/blog?id=qwen-image-2.1#local-editing-flexible-region-selection\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow ugc\">#</a></h3>\n  <p>Qwen-Image-2.1 支持用圆圈、手绘标注和独立掩码来指定编辑应当发生的位置。</p>\n  <p>第一个示例使用不同颜色的圆圈一次性标出三个区域：“移除蓝色圆圈中的金属手表，将红色圆圈中的头发改为黑色，并将绿色圆圈中的区域替换为灰色短袖亚麻睡衣。”标注后的输入在左侧，结果在右侧。</p>\n  <img src=\"https://aihot.news/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fqianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com%2FQwen-Image%2Fimage2.1%2Fimages%2Fexample-18.png&amp;exp=1789992000&amp;sig=d04570830dff1c094ca5be103e57e621f70adc0a4ac7263b5e69f8685af86dea\" alt=\"Circle-guided editing of a watch, hair, and clothing (1)\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"same-origin\"> <img src=\"https://aihot.news/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fqianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com%2FQwen-Image%2Fimage2.1%2Fimages%2Fexample-19.png&amp;exp=1789992000&amp;sig=abdbcf5708332d328a6c823bf2c1688d188911424631c054226fb433007ca4c4\" alt=\"Circle-guided editing of a watch, hair, and clothing (2)\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"same-origin\">\n  <p>手绘标注提供了另一种标出区域的方式。在这个示例中，模型在输入图像右侧用白色标出的区域中添加了一名潜水员。</p>\n  <img src=\"https://aihot.news/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fqianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com%2FQwen-Image%2Fimage2.1%2Fimages%2Fexample-20.png&amp;exp=1789992000&amp;sig=efcd555c8bcfc7d692dc67161b122dfe2cb2064f6aff277825fd0520e4860924\" alt=\"Paint-guided editing: adding a diver to the marked region (1)\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"same-origin\"> <img src=\"https://aihot.news/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fqianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com%2FQwen-Image%2Fimage2.1%2Fimages%2Fexample-21.png&amp;exp=1789992000&amp;sig=e6159ebc7ff52e18feafd90fc11e4f69ced95f4827ae9d80c6e2e38c1d2d062b\" alt=\"Paint-guided editing: adding a diver to the marked region (2)\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"same-origin\">\n  <p>圆圈和手绘标注会遮挡部分原始内容。为保留完整输入，Qwen-Image-2.1 还支持<strong>将原始图像和单独的掩码作为两个输入</strong>。以下示例要求模型使用这两张图像生成一个骑马牛仔：</p>\n  <img src=\"https://aihot.news/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fqianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com%2FQwen-Image%2Fimage2.1%2Fimages%2Fexample-22.png&amp;exp=1789992000&amp;sig=0900803f5b031006b477eb612624a8aa10a0a164e81d23d644951fd4bd393e52\" alt=\"Local editing inputs: original image and separate mask (1)\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"same-origin\"> <img src=\"https://aihot.news/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fqianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com%2FQwen-Image%2Fimage2.1%2Fimages%2Fexample-23.png&amp;exp=1789992000&amp;sig=5427691343b2ab5dfeb89f46fb79120c29c8c9d7dbb4de3804b750483289bbd9\" alt=\"Local editing inputs: original image and separate mask (2)\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"same-origin\">\n  <p>模型对掩码指定的区域进行编辑，生成以下结果：</p>\n  <figure>\n   <img src=\"https://aihot.news/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fqianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com%2FQwen-Image%2Fimage2.1%2Fimages%2Fexample-24.png&amp;exp=1789992000&amp;sig=85ca77622bf55f6304133d8cc8340626d8586037bd3fddc456cf6e5135f18177\" alt=\"Mask-guided editing result: a cowboy on horseback\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"same-origin\">\n   <figcaption>\n    <p>掩码引导编辑结果：一个骑马牛仔</p>\n   </figcaption>\n  </figure>\n  <p>局部编辑还可以支持连续创作。通过在保留场景其余部分的同时进行连续修改，编辑后的图像可以组合成简单的动画，如下方的水豚葫芦兄弟示例所示。</p>\n  <figure data-aihot-media=\"video\">\n   <a href=\"https://qwen.ai/blog?id=qwen-image-2.1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow ugc\" data-aihot-media=\"video-link\">视频 · 前往原文观看</a>\n  </figure>\n  <h3>保真度：保留人物与产品<a href=\"https://qwen.ai/blog?id=qwen-image-2.1#fidelity-preserving-people-and-products\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow ugc\">#</a></h3>\n  <p>保真度的改进主要集中在<strong>人像身份</strong>和<strong>产品一致性</strong>上。对于人像，模型能更好地保留面部特征，使人物身份在多次编辑中保持更高的一致性。下方每一组左侧为输入，右侧为编辑结果。</p>\n  <img src=\"https://aihot.news/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fqianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com%2FQwen-Image%2Fimage2.1%2Fimages%2Fexample-25.png&amp;exp=1789992000&amp;sig=bf8e95cf0030d3026a9bc75152f0af9aa40498c95b5b8dc34d9105fe6b150f78\" alt=\"Portrait fidelity example one: input and result (1)\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"same-origin\"> <img src=\"https://aihot.news/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fqianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com%2FQwen-Image%2Fimage2.1%2Fimages%2Fexample-26.png&amp;exp=1789992000&amp;sig=a1635f83f29233a440b173c40cfebf7b5aa7612b715efc44d868c8d85cf8f419\" alt=\"Portrait fidelity example one: input and result (2)\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"same-origin\"> <img src=\"https://aihot.news/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fqianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com%2FQwen-Image%2Fimage2.1%2Fimages%2Fexample-27.png&amp;exp=1789992000&amp;sig=a371c4d201403762edefc93ab00493385041343f424216c60c987bd1b64db9e5\" alt=\"Portrait fidelity example two: input and result (1)\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"same-origin\"> <img src=\"https://aihot.news/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fqianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com%2FQwen-Image%2Fimage2.1%2Fimages%2Fexample-28.png&amp;exp=1789992000&amp;sig=75fb3c52a907e9ff381dbea8a79edf20832d4ef3290ceaf5ba156939867204cd\" alt=\"Portrait fidelity example two: input and result (2)\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"same-origin\"> <img src=\"https://aihot.news/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fqianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com%2FQwen-Image%2Fimage2.1%2Fimages%2Fexample-29.png&amp;exp=1789992000&amp;sig=44a0573db9f50b7d2c6d7efde39344eb9ce89ae7784e39ffe0b97371b61deb6b\" alt=\"Portrait fidelity example three: input and result (1)\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"same-origin\"> <img src=\"https://aihot.news/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fqianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com%2FQwen-Image%2Fimage2.1%2Fimages%2Fexample-30.png&amp;exp=1789992000&amp;sig=ca3b6568735d25224ce31740a8f6dba5be949cc4668f14165e0433da16a4df39\" alt=\"Portrait fidelity example three: input and result (2)\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"same-origin\">\n  <p>对于产品编辑，模型旨在保留文字、纹理和形状，使产品的标志性特征在新图像中保持一致。</p>\n  <img src=\"https://aihot.news/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fqianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com%2FQwen-Image%2Fimage2.1%2Fimages%2Fexample-31.png&amp;exp=1789992000&amp;sig=b07dca9fba3e8b653427f00896ca52069f35c06b3a9b4e5434d3cd6640bda3bf\" alt=\"Product fidelity example one: input and result (1)\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"same-origin\"> <img src=\"https://aihot.news/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fqianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com%2FQwen-Image%2Fimage2.1%2Fimages%2Fexample-32.png&amp;exp=1789992000&amp;sig=30fd6baf096660a9add219df8ff74d2b3cc268852fa4b9f518185abd1737db21\" alt=\"Product fidelity example one: input and result (2)\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"same-origin\"> <img src=\"https://aihot.news/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fqianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com%2FQwen-Image%2Fimage2.1%2Fimages%2Fexample-33.png&amp;exp=1789992000&amp;sig=63abb28c8d92d7b8dcbcddfd39d6869cf0364bb0483838475c667ac5d81a9c92\" alt=\"Product fidelity example two: input and result (1)\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"same-origin\"> <img src=\"https://aihot.news/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fqianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com%2FQwen-Image%2Fimage2.1%2Fimages%2Fexample-34.png&amp;exp=1789992000&amp;sig=c7fc7029fac67cff29a7e5962bf2f9ec8c80ac04d8b95ac44c793fe9752faab4\" alt=\"Product fidelity example two: input and result (2)\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"same-origin\"> <img src=\"https://aihot.news/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fqianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com%2FQwen-Image%2Fimage2.1%2Fimages%2Fexample-35.png&amp;exp=1789992000&amp;sig=1fcdf555aab4a48170b3949b4dec122454d0ae1dd5eb88b1d10b84d82c202d86\" alt=\"Product fidelity example three: input and result (1)\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"same-origin\"> <img src=\"https://aihot.news/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fqianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com%2FQwen-Image%2Fimage2.1%2Fimages%2Fexample-36.png&amp;exp=1789992000&amp;sig=307a177e993762ac261f7ea8ccde18d41824c22136a62fa7911a0643858aad73\" alt=\"Product fidelity example three: input and result (2)\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"same-origin\">\n  <h3>任务覆盖范围：全景图、信息图与故事板<a href=\"https://qwen.ai/blog?id=qwen-image-2.1#task-coverage-panoramas-infographics-and-storyboards\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow ugc\">#</a></h3>\n  <p>Qwen-Image-2.1 支持广泛的编辑任务，包括全景图、信息图和分镜图生成，在不同应用之间实现了能力平衡。</p>\n  <p>例如，从这张自拍开始：</p>\n  <figure>\n   <img src=\"https://aihot.news/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fqianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com%2FQwen-Image%2Fimage2.1%2Fimages%2Fexample-37.png&amp;exp=1789992000&amp;sig=39e190dcf4343c0130dd292ed4d6d62c04b5bb01e648355ca265b4fe01a832aa\" alt=\"Input selfie for panorama generation\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"same-origin\">\n   <figcaption>\n    <p>用于全景图生成的输入自拍</p>\n   </figcaption>\n  </figure>\n  <p>模型生成了以下全景图：</p>\n  <figure>\n   <img src=\"https://aihot.news/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fqianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com%2FQwen-Image%2Fimage2.1%2Fimages%2Fexample-38.png&amp;exp=1789992000&amp;sig=d345e9efad5e3cdb3b7e49f638255ba2a74826043d4fcfd14f27eb1d5ec83588\" alt=\"Panorama generated from the selfie\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"same-origin\">\n   <figcaption>\n    <p>由自拍生成的全景图</p>\n   </figcaption>\n  </figure>\n  <p>随后可以在可视化工具中从不同视角方向探索这张全景图。</p>\n  <figure data-aihot-media=\"video\">\n   <a href=\"https://qwen.ai/blog?id=qwen-image-2.1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow ugc\" data-aihot-media=\"video-link\">视频 · 前往原文观看</a>\n  </figure>\n  <p>在信息图生成方面，一张模特照片可以被扩展为细节丰富、信息密集的构图。</p>\n  <figure>\n   <img src=\"https://aihot.news/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fqianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com%2FQwen-Image%2Fimage2.1%2Fimages%2Fexample-39.png&amp;exp=1789992000&amp;sig=767d4524a36f192a7366788af332b3154649f29c5623f8aa5a4a13da9408df07\" alt=\"Input model photograph for infographic generation\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"same-origin\">\n   <figcaption>\n    <p>用于信息图生成的输入模特照片</p>\n   </figcaption>\n  </figure>\n  <figure>\n   <img src=\"https://aihot.news/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fqianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com%2FQwen-Image%2Fimage2.1%2Fimages%2Fexample-40.png&amp;exp=1789992000&amp;sig=a4bb587c354ff1b88e80f9092b90c025b466b33ce34bdf6e0500d3381fc11312\" alt=\"Complex infographic generated from the model photograph\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"same-origin\">\n   <figcaption>\n    <p>由模特照片生成的复杂信息图</p>\n   </figcaption>\n  </figure>\n  <p>该模型还可以将三视图角色参考图转化为完整的分镜图，为故事叙述和视觉叙事提供素材。</p>\n  <figure>\n   <img src=\"https://aihot.news/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fqianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com%2FQwen-Image%2Fimage2.1%2Fimages%2Fexample-41.png&amp;exp=1789992000&amp;sig=d90765e417c8f408c90cfd268176c5393682128a2d1d92535db03d1c2fe78362\" alt=\"Three-view character reference for storyboard generation\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"same-origin\">\n   <figcaption>\n    <p>用于分镜图生成的三视图角色参考图</p>\n   </figcaption>\n  </figure>\n  <figure>\n   <img src=\"https://aihot.news/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fqianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com%2FQwen-Image%2Fimage2.1%2Fimages%2Fexample-42.png&amp;exp=1789992000&amp;sig=b3bf6df283efbe93d999f19241ab56f71d8ba9b5d8128b79275d8b0bc33fa3bf\" alt=\"Complete storyboard generated from the character reference\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"same-origin\">\n   <figcaption>\n    <p>由角色参考图生成的完整分镜图</p>\n   </figcaption>\n  </figure>\n  <h2>逼真的纹理与精致的美学<a href=\"https://qwen.ai/blog?id=qwen-image-2.1#realistic-textures-and-refined-aesthetics\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow ugc\">#</a></h2>\n  <p>Qwen-Image-2.1 进一步提升了视觉质量，尤其关注排版和肖像。文本渲染不仅考虑内容本身，还考虑字体样式、布局及其与整体构图的关系。以下示例展示了不同场景下的文本渲染效果。</p>\n  <figure>\n   <img src=\"https://aihot.news/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fqianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com%2FQwen-Image%2Fimage2.1%2Fimages%2Fexample-43.png&amp;exp=1789992000&amp;sig=fab12e93a12a3aa4cf4737c321363a431823ad088ab28e7a67e27325fd91dc90\" alt=\"Text rendering example one\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"same-origin\">\n   <figcaption>\n    <p>文本渲染示例一</p>\n   </figcaption>\n  </figure>\n  <figure>\n   <img src=\"https://aihot.news/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fqianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com%2FQwen-Image%2Fimage2.1%2Fimages%2Fexample-44.png&amp;exp=1789992000&amp;sig=2dac98bb7781e8a6a823af709d5bd882e3ba56674ee98a47f129a17944334cb0\" alt=\"Text rendering example two\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"same-origin\">\n   <figcaption>\n    <p>文本渲染示例二</p>\n   </figcaption>\n  </figure>\n  <figure>\n   <img src=\"https://aihot.news/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fqianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com%2FQwen-Image%2Fimage2.1%2Fimages%2Fexample-45.png&amp;exp=1789992000&amp;sig=f7e8bf86d5d40a89261723fca67a1cabe3af4239bb624ac5979ec9a634149f69\" alt=\"Text rendering example three\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"same-origin\">\n   <figcaption>\n    <p>文本渲染示例三</p>\n   </figcaption>\n  </figure>\n  <figure>\n   <img src=\"https://aihot.news/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fqianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com%2FQwen-Image%2Fimage2.1%2Fimages%2Fexample-46.png&amp;exp=1789992000&amp;sig=7fde43a0fa8244a92bf1250cd6112e1d0c765335c47423b4e07cdc482e1a1d32\" alt=\"Text rendering example four\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"same-origin\">\n   <figcaption>\n    <p>文本渲染示例四</p>\n   </figcaption>\n  </figure>\n  <p>对于肖像，改进的光照和精细细节让生成的图像呈现出更逼真的外观。</p>\n  <figure>\n   <img src=\"https://aihot.news/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fqianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com%2FQwen-Image%2Fimage2.1%2Fimages%2Fexample-47.png&amp;exp=1789992000&amp;sig=4dd8ca2fcea077fce89058d81298dd632e7de9629db5e61d294f7e2301fc5b70\" alt=\"Portrait lighting and detail example one\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"same-origin\">\n   <figcaption>\n    <p>肖像光照与细节示例一</p>\n   </figcaption>\n  </figure>\n  <figure>\n   <img src=\"https://aihot.news/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fqianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com%2FQwen-Image%2Fimage2.1%2Fimages%2Fexample-48.png&amp;exp=1789992000&amp;sig=c6014b35e962550275d5599337071d8359f89b803115b6833f741687d09d04ea\" alt=\"Portrait lighting and detail example two\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"same-origin\">\n   <figcaption>\n    <p>肖像光照与细节示例二</p>\n   </figcaption>\n  </figure>\n  <h2>结论<a href=\"https://qwen.ai/blog?id=qwen-image-2.1#conclusion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow ugc\">#</a></h2>\n  <p>凭借紧凑的 7B 视觉生成组件，Qwen-Image-2.1 将图像生成、透明度和广泛的编辑能力集于一个模型之中。更快的推理速度、最多支持 10 张参考图像、灵活的局部编辑，以及对人物和产品更高的保真度，使其成为设计、内容创作、电商和视觉叙事的实用工具。</p>\n  <p>希望您喜欢用 Qwen-Image-2.1 进行创作！</p>\n </body>\n</html>",
  "aiSummary": "Qwen 发布 Qwen-Image-2.1，一款 7B 参数的开源模型，统一生成与编辑并原生支持透明图像。",
